  "description": "The \u0027dss_projects_cached\u0027 dataset provides a comprehensive overview of projects within a Dataiku Data Science Studio (DSS) environment. It includes essential information such as unique project identifiers, descriptive names, and detailed descriptions, which are crucial for understanding the purpose and scope of each project. The dataset also captures metadata like the project owner\u0027s email, current status, and tags, which help categorize and manage projects effectively. Additionally, it records the last modification timestamp, indicating the most recent updates, and whether a project is a tutorial, which is useful for educational purposes. The dataset is particularly valuable for project management, allowing users to track project progress, identify responsible parties, and access projects directly via URLs. It also supports collaboration by listing contributors and categorizing projects with tags. This dataset is ideal for administrators and data scientists who need to manage and analyze multiple projects within a DSS environment, ensuring efficient project tracking and resource allocation.",
  "shortDesc": "Dataset of cached DSS projects with details on identifiers, descriptions, and statuses.",
